<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-FIFA VICE-PRESIDENT GUILLERMO CANEDO DIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIFA VICE-PRESIDENT GUILLERMO CANEDO DIES.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Guillermo Canedo, a FIFA vice-president and chairman of the World Cup organising committee, died on Tuesday after a long fight against cancer. He was 76.</p>
<p>Canedo, a lawyer by profession, joined the FIFA executive committee in 1962 and was head of both the 1970 and 1986 Mexican World Cup organising committees.</p>
